<title>POLAND: Polish grain prices mixed, livestock eases mth/mth.</title>
<headline>Polish grain prices mixed, livestock eases mth/mth.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish procurement wheat, pork and beef prices fell in January against December, while rye and milk prices rose, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>POLISH FARM GOODS PRICES	     JAN 97     DEC 96    JAN 96</p>
<p>WHEAT</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  55.38     57.04    48.62</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-2.9	-2.5     13.9</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			13.9	33.6     33.7</p>
<p>@RYE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per 100 kg		  40.82     40.53    28.50</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 0.7	 0.2     11.4</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			43.2	58.5     21.9</p>
<p>CATTLE</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 2.61	2.62     2.61</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-0.3	 1.9	0.8</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			 0.1	 1.2     32.1</p>
<p>PORK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per kg			 3.38	3.39     2.56</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		-0.3	-2.4     -1.7</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			31.8	29.8     -3.4</p>
<p>@MILK</p>
<p>   in zlotys per litre		    0.57	0.56     0.51</p>
<p>   month/month pct change		 1.7	 2.9	1.3</p>
<p>   yr/yr pct change			10.6	10.2     32.2</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
